          "title": "Dashboard Details",
          "text": {
            "content": "This dashboard gives a high-level summary of which customers are using which VSA volume features and where they run. \nIt shows feature adoption (Backup, Autotier, CRR, Large Volumes) across the fleet at a glance.\n\n# High Level Dashboards\n\n    1. Customer-centric views (by account_name)\n    2. Region specific views\n    3. Feature-centric views (Backup, Autotier, CRR, Large Volumes)\n\n\n## Workflow Summary\n\n    1. Adoption of Backup (CBS), Autotier, CRR, and Large Volumes across the fleet\n    2. Top customers per feature, filterable by location and account_name\n",
